Usage: nimbu channels <command> [flags]

Manage channels and entries

Commands:
  list       List channels
  get        Get channel details
  create     Create a channel from JSON or inline assignments
  info       Show rich channel info and TypeScript output
  types      Generate one TypeScript module with the types of all channels
  copy       Copy channel configuration between sites
  diff       Diff channel configuration between sites
  empty      Empty a channel (requires --force and --confirm)
  delete     Delete a channel (requires --force)
  entries    Manage channel entries
  fields     Manage channel fields

Global Flags:
  -h, --help           Show context-sensitive help.
      --env=STRING     Named project environment (overrides site and API URL)
      --site=STRING    Site ID/subdomain (else nimbu.yml, config) ($NIMBU_SITE)
      --json           Output JSON to stdout ($NIMBU_JSON)
      --plain          Output stable TSV to stdout ($NIMBU_PLAIN)
      --verbose        Enable verbose logging
      --debug          Enable debug logging (HTTP traces)
      --version        Print version and exit

Run "nimbu channels <command> --help" for more information on a command.
Run "nimbu channels --help-all" for all flags.
